                (h : IsPlausibleStep (Std.Iterators.IterStep.yield.{u + 1, w + 1} it' out)) →\n                  motive (Subtype.mk.{max (u + 1) (w + 1)} (Std.Iterators.IterStep.yield.{u + 1, w + 1} it' out) h)) →\n            ((it' : α) →\n                (h : IsPlausibleStep (Std.Iterators.IterStep.skip.{u + 1, w + 1} it')) →\n                  motive (Subtype.mk.{max (u + 1) (w + 1)} (Std.Iterators.IterStep.skip.{u + 1, w + 1} it') h)) →\n              ((h : IsPlausibleStep Std.Iterators.IterStep.done.{u + 1, w + 1}) →\n                  motive (Subtype.mk.{max (u + 1) (w + 1)} Std.Iterators.IterStep.done.{u + 1, w + 1} h)) →\n                motive s","unsafe":false,"value":122,"source":{"code":"/--\nA more convenient `cases` eliminator for `PlausibleIterStep`.\n-/\n@[elab_as_elim, cases_eliminator]\nabbrev PlausibleIterStep.casesOn {IsPlausibleStep : IterStep α β → Prop}\n    {motive : PlausibleIterStep IsPlausibleStep → Sort x} (s : PlausibleIterStep IsPlausibleStep)\n    (yield : ∀ it' out h, motive ⟨.yield it' out, h⟩)\n    (skip : ∀ it' h, motive ⟨.skip it', h⟩)\n    (done : ∀ h, motive ⟨.done, h⟩) : motive s :=\n  match s with\n  | .yield it' out h => yield it' out h\n  | .skip it' h => skip it' h\n  | .done h => done h","start":331,"end":343},"axioms":[]}